<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49720" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰάσιμος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑᾱ</span>], 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰήσιμος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰάομαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>curable</i>, of persons, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαρμάκοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					475
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.Sacr.</u>
				11
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνίατος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				941d
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαφθείρεσθαι ἰάσιμος ὤν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					4.2.4
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <i>appeasable</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					399
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of wounds,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τραῦμα ἰ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				878c
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. ἁμάρτημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					525b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					731d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. τὸ πάθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					124.4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
